<title>LEBANON: Lebanon bank assets up 0.39 pct in Jan- Banks Assn.</title>
<headline>Lebanon bank assets up 0.39 pct in Jan- Banks Assn.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total assets of Lebanon's banks rose 0.39 percent in January, the Lebanese Banks Association reported on Friday.</p>
<p>The association issued the following banking sector details (in billions of Lebanese pounds, at end of period unless otherwise stated):</p>
<p>		    Oct 96   Nov 96   Dec 96   Jan 97</p>
<p>Total Assets    34,775   35,784   37,183   37,326</p>
<p>Month change (%)  4.26     2.90     3.91     0.39</p>
<p>Deposits of Residents and Non-residents</p>
<p>		    29,062   29,870   30,685   30,883</p>
<p>Month change(%)   5.06     2.78     2.73     0.65</p>
<p>Claims on Residents and Non-residents</p>
<p>		     12,613   13,014   13,290   13,398</p>
<p>Month change(%)    1.91     3.18     2.12     0.82</p>
<p>Total capital     1,401    1,539    1,943    1,970</p>
<p>Month change (%)   1.17     9.83    26.30     1.37</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (961 1) 602057</p>
</text>
